        <object label="&lt;b&gt;ecommerce.db&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;SQLite, WAL :105 &amp;middot; path :20&lt;br&gt;8 cat, 50 users, 30 products&lt;br&gt;200 orders, 1-5 items each :212" class="component.artifact" id="n_db">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;fillColor=#C8E6C9;strokeColor=#2E7D32;fontSize=9;fontColor=#232F3E;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;" parent="1" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="1232" y="440" width="256" height="80" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object label="&lt;b&gt;query TOOL — EVERY GUARD, IN CODE ORDER &amp;middot; server.js:49-136&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;trimmed = sql.trim().toUpperCase() :51&lt;br&gt;1  must start with SELECT :54 — else refusal :63&lt;br&gt;withoutStrings = literals blanked :68 — checks 2-4 run on this copy&lt;br&gt;2  split on &#x27;;&#x27;, more than one statement :69 :70 — refusal :78&lt;br&gt;3  17 blocked keywords, anywhere incl. subqueries :83 :84 — refusal :92&lt;br&gt;4  SQL comments -- or /* :97 — refusal :106&lt;br&gt;then  effectiveLimit = min(limit || 100, 1000) :110&lt;br&gt;        LIMIT appended when the SQL has none :113 :114&lt;br&gt;        db.prepare(execSql).all() -&amp;gt; { rowCount, rows } :117 :121&lt;br&gt;catch -&amp;gt; { error } + isError :127-134 — the handler never throws" class="card.invariant" id="card_gate">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;fillColor=#E8EAF6;strokeColor=#3F51B5;fontSize=8;fontColor=#232F3E;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacingLeft=6;opacity=70;" parent="1" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="288" y="512" width="456" height="160" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object label="&lt;b&gt;BLOCKED KEYWORDS — all 17, in regex order &amp;middot; server.js:83&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;DROP &amp;middot; ALTER &amp;middot; CREATE &amp;middot; DELETE &amp;middot; INSERT &amp;middot; UPDATE &amp;middot; TRUNCATE&lt;br&gt;REPLACE &amp;middot; EXEC &amp;middot; EXECUTE &amp;middot; GRANT &amp;middot; REVOKE &amp;middot; ATTACH &amp;middot; DETACH&lt;br&gt;PRAGMA &amp;middot; REINDEX &amp;middot; VACUUM      case-insensitive, word-boundary&lt;br&gt;4 refusals in query :63 :78 :92 :106, 1 in describe_table :187&lt;br&gt;every one is a normal MCP result carrying isError — not an exception" class="card.failure" id="card_deny">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;fillColor=#FFEBEE;strokeColor=#C62828;fontSize=8;fontColor=#232F3E;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacingLeft=6;opacity=70;" parent="1" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="288" y="688" width="456" height="88" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object label="&lt;b&gt;MCP SURFACE — the complete declared set &amp;middot; server.js&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;TOOL  query(sql, limit? = 100, capped at 1000) :42 :46 :47 :110&lt;br&gt;TOOL  list_tables() — no params :143 :146&lt;br&gt;TOOL  describe_table(table_name) :174 :178&lt;br&gt;RES   db://schema   application/json :258 :260 :263&lt;br&gt;RES   db://stats    application/json :299 :301 :303&lt;br&gt;these 5 and nothing else — no server.prompt() exists in src/&lt;br&gt;client learns them at runtime: listTools :93, listResources :121" class="card.primitive" id="card_surface">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#E65100;fontSize=8;fontColor=#232F3E;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacingLeft=6;opacity=70;" parent="1" vertex="1">
